\newlabel{fig:GC_Mamba_rollout}{{1a}{3}{Autoregressive rollout over three six-hour steps. Each GraphCast--Mamba forecast advances the two-frame input window; dashed orange arrows carry the temporal memory state, initialized here with $m_{-1}=0$.\relax }{figure.caption.1}{}}
