\newlabel{fig:channels_improved_k22}{{8}{16}{Breadth of forecast improvements for the archived $K=22$ correction. At each lead, a channel is counted when its latitude-weighted RMSE is lower than that of its paired GraphCast baseline. The 83 channels comprise five surface variables and six upper-air variables at 13 pressure levels. The count reaches 81 at day 4, remains at 82--83 from 114\,h onward, and is 82 at day 10. This counts the signs of the RMSE differences and does not establish statistical significance for individual channels.\relax }{figure.caption.22}{}}
